Feature: union_tag_cross_ns — finding #4: a `T | error` / `T | null` union's C tag, `tk_u_` typedef
  and `.as.` field must be derived from T's FULL CANONICAL name, so two same-bare-named structs in
  DIFFERENT namespaces (`a::Thing` vs `b::Thing`) generate DISTINCT C symbols instead of colliding at
  `cc` with `incompatible types`. Each scenario names itself and asserts its value through `run` in
  `src/sc.tks`; a root-namespace and a builtin union guard the unchanged-mangling invariant.

  Scenario: cross_ns_named_a — `a::Thing | error` reads a's payload 11, not b's (→ 11)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario cross_ns_named_a: ok"

  Scenario: cross_ns_named_b — `b::Thing | error` reads b's payload 22, not a's (→ 22)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario cross_ns_named_b: ok"

  Scenario: cross_ns_null_a_present — `a::Thing | null` present reads 11 (→ 11)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario cross_ns_null_a_present: ok"

  Scenario: cross_ns_null_a_absent — `a::Thing | null` null reads -1 (→ -1)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario cross_ns_null_a_absent: ok"

  Scenario: cross_ns_null_b_present — `b::Thing | null` present reads 22 (→ 22)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario cross_ns_null_b_present: ok"

  Scenario: cross_ns_null_b_absent — `b::Thing | null` null reads -1 (→ -1)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario cross_ns_null_b_absent: ok"

  Scenario: named_variant_ns_a — `a::Step` (= `Thing | Note`) destructures a's `Thing` (→ 11)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario named_variant_ns_a: ok"

  Scenario: named_variant_ns_b — `b::Step` (= `Thing | Note`) destructures b's `Note` (→ 99)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario named_variant_ns_b: ok"

  Scenario: root_unchanged_foo — a root-namespace `Foo | error` still round-trips (→ 7)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario root_unchanged_foo: ok"

  Scenario: root_unchanged_bar — a root-namespace `Bar | null` still round-trips (→ 8)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario root_unchanged_bar: ok"

  Scenario: builtin_union — `i64 | error` and `str | null` keys are untouched (→ 5)
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario builtin_union: ok"
